**Part-planner lane title (Squad Leader spawn + part-planner self-refresh).**
Part-planner child lanes must use a compact part-index prefix so Mission Control
lane tabs stay readable within the 64-char **`title`** limit — **not** the skill
frontmatter name alone (which truncates to `"Part Planne…"`).

| Agent | Obligation |
|-------|------------|
| **Squad Leader** (§6 spawn) | Set spawn **`name`** to the format below; one-line **`description`** (part scope, ≤512 chars) |
| **Part planner** (own slot) | After warm-up, call **`mission_control_update_lane_display`** with the same **`title`** when spawn chrome is stale or generic; optional **`hoverDescription`** with full `partId` + `partTitle` |

**Title format (binding):**

```text
P{nn} — {partTitle}
```

- `{nn}` — zero-padded two-digit part index from `partId` (e.g. `1` → `01`;
  `part-3` → `03`; when `partId` has no digits, use its first two alphanumeric
  chars uppercased, zero-pad left to 2)
- `{partTitle}` — master-plan part title; truncate **tail** only if the full
  string exceeds **64** chars (keep `P{nn} — ` intact)
- **Forbidden:** spawn **`name`** / lane **`title`** starting with `"Part Planner"`
  or copied from skill frontmatter **`name`** alone

